@startuml Arquitetura_Componentes_MiniPar_2025_1
!theme plain
title Arquitetura de Componentes de Software - Compilador MiniPar 2025.1

' Definição dos componentes principais
package "Frontend Layer" {
    [Web Editor] as WebEditor
    [CLI Interface] as CLI
    [REST API] as API
}

package "Compiler Core" {
    [Lexer Component] as Lexer
    [Parser Component] as Parser  
    [Semantic Analyzer] as Semantic
    [Symbol Table Manager] as SymTable
    [TAC Generator] as TACGen
    [ARM Generator] as ARMGen
}

package "Runtime Layer" {
    [Interpreter] as Interpreter
    [Thread Manager] as ThreadMgr
    [Socket Manager] as SocketMgr
    [Memory Manager] as MemMgr
}

package "Support Components" {
    [AST Builder] as AST
    [Error Handler] as ErrorHandler
    [Utils Library] as Utils
    [File Manager] as FileMgr
}

package "External Systems" {
    [CPULator] as CPULator
    [ANTLR Runtime] as ANTLR
    [Python Threading] as Threading
    [Socket Library] as Sockets
}

' Interfaces principais
interface "ILexer" as ILexer
interface "IParser" as IParser  
interface "ISemantic" as ISemantic
interface "IRunner" as IRunner
interface "ISymbolTable" as ISymTable

' Conexões entre componentes
WebEditor --> API : HTTP Request
CLI --> Lexer : Direct Call
API --> Lexer : Process Code

Lexer ..|> ILexer
Parser ..|> IParser
Semantic ..|> ISemantic
Interpreter ..|> IRunner
SymTable ..|> ISymTable

' Pipeline principal do compilador
Lexer --> Parser : Token Stream
Parser --> AST : Generates
Parser --> SymTable : Updates
AST --> Semantic : Validates
Semantic --> SymTable : Checks
Semantic --> TACGen : Valid AST
TACGen --> ARMGen : TAC Code
ARMGen --> CPULator : ARM Assembly

' Runtime components
Interpreter --> ThreadMgr : PAR blocks
Interpreter --> SocketMgr : Channels
Interpreter --> MemMgr : Variables
ThreadMgr --> Threading : Uses
SocketMgr --> Sockets : Uses

' Support connections
Parser --> ErrorHandler : Errors
Semantic --> ErrorHandler : Validation Errors
Lexer --> Utils : String Processing
Parser --> Utils : Token Processing
FileMgr --> Utils : File Operations

' External dependencies
Lexer --> ANTLR : Grammar Processing
Parser --> ANTLR : Grammar Processing

' Notas explicativas
note right of Lexer
  **Analisador Léxico**
  - Tokenização do código MiniPar
  - Reconhece palavras-chave
  - Filtra comentários
  - Implementa regex patterns
end note

note right of Parser
  **Analisador Sintático**
  - Gera AST a partir de tokens
  - Implementa gramática MiniPar
  - Verifica sintaxe
  - Gerencia tabela de símbolos
end note

note right of Semantic
  **Analisador Semântico**
  - Verificação de tipos
  - Validação de escopo
  - Análise de fluxo de controle
  - Detecção de erros semânticos
end note

note right of TACGen
  **Gerador TAC**
  - Código de três endereços
  - Otimizações básicas
  - Preparação para ARM
  - Formato textual
end note

note right of ARMGen
  **Gerador Assembly ARM**
  - Assembly ARMv7
  - Compatível com CPULator
  - Mapeamento de registradores
  - System calls
end note

note right of ThreadMgr
  **Gerenciador de Threads**
  - Execução paralela (PAR)
  - Multiprocessing.Pool
  - Sincronização
  - Isolamento de contexto
end note

note right of SocketMgr
  **Gerenciador de Sockets**
  - Canais c_channel/s_channel
  - Comunicação TCP/IP
  - Cliente/Servidor
  - Threading para múltiplas conexões
end note

@enduml